  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sword_of_Shadow\">Sword of Shadow</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #CCFF99 solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:#EEFFCC;--bg-color-2-dark:#272F17;--header-color:#CCFF99;--header-color-dark:#3D5F1A;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99; width: 15%;\">Proficiency Class\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC; width: 42.5%;\">Martial Weapon Proficiency\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"19\" style=\"background:#EEFFCC;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg/420px-Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"226\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg/630px-Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg/840px-Sword_of_Shadow_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Accepts Sentience?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Damage and Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">[2d6] + 5 Slash, Adamantine, Magic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\"><a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">Critical threat range</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">17-20 / x3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Weapon Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Great_Sword\" title=\"Great Sword\">Great Sword</a></b> / Slashing weapons\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">No UMD needed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Handedness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Attack Mod\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">STR\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Damage Mod\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">STR\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Weapons made of adamantine have the ability to bypass the protective damage reduction of certain monsters.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0004305000</span>4,305<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">8 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/Plane_of_Night\" title=\"Plane of Night\">Plane of Night</a></b>, Raid Warded Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Weapons made of adamantine have the ability to bypass the protective damage reduction of certain monsters.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Sword_of_Shadow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Sword_of_Shadow.png/420px-Sword_of_Shadow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"455\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Sword_of_Shadow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Sword_of_Shadow\" title=\"Item:Epic Sword of Shadow\">Epic Sword of Shadow</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This great sword was forged inside the Vault of Night itself. The essence of Shadow has seeped into this sword granting it exceptional death-dealing abilities.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>This greatsword has both an expanded critical threat range (same as a falchion with improved crit) and the x3 multiplier of a greataxe.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817215735\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.120 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3209/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26842/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6151/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n128.50%  133.983     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  104.269      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  104.269      1 -total\n 97.35%  101.503      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 45.62%   47.571      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.90%   46.820      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 42.04%   43.833      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 40.08%   41.787      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.49%   22.410      2 Template:Mat\n 20.53%   21.408      5 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:5711-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817215735 and revision id 635152. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
